    {
      "source": {
        "path": "C:/workspace/ck3_eternal_recurrence/docs/ck3-mod-development-paradigm.md",
        "bytes": 21430,
        "sha256": "b47e6b51b613b7a9d6bade43cdee18b34422323d657918bc66cc11dba2b4d7f3"
      },
      "first_line": 87,
      "last_line": 95,
      "claim": "Exact original/script scope and same-key override must be explicit",
      "lines": [
        "## 四、原版优先：先证明 CK3 怎样工作",
        "",
        "实现任何新机制前，应该先检查当前 exact build 中最接近的原版实现：",
        "",
        "- 同类型的 decision、event、interaction、on_action、scripted effect、scripted trigger 或 GUI。",
        "- 调用者提供的 `root`、`scope:*`、saved scope、目标对象类型和可能为空的对象。",
        "- 可见条件、可用条件、AI 条件、成本、取消路径和执行时机。",
        "- 同名条目跨文件的覆盖/合并规则，以及是否真的需要覆盖原版。",
        "- 原版本地化、图像格式和 GUI provider 怎样绑定运行时对象。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": {
        "path": "C:/workspace/ck3_eternal_recurrence/docs/ck3-mod-development-paradigm.md",
        "bytes": 21430,
        "sha256": "b47e6b51b613b7a9d6bade43cdee18b34422323d657918bc66cc11dba2b4d7f3"
      },
      "first_line": 180,
      "last_line": 189,
      "claim": "Scope type/lifetime/GUI observation limits",
      "lines": [
        "## 八、实现时必须明确的运行时合同",
        "",
        "每个机制至少审阅以下边界：",
        "",
        "### 作用域与对象生命周期",
        "",
        "- 当前 scope 的类型是什么，切换后是否仍是预期对象。",
        "- `root`、saved scope、event target 和 iterator 内 scope 是否被混用。",
        "- 对象是否可能死亡、失去头衔、被销毁或在延迟事件到达前失效。",
        "- 同帧写入是否会立即被 GUI、tooltip 或另一个 effect 观察到。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": {
        "path": "C:/lr29s2/mod_li_yu_dao/common/scripted_effects/lyd_i3b_setup_effects.txt",
        "bytes": 6758,
        "sha256": "1642d32f82334a97a760a53e22d072d8f1b6ffcb1ba29a8ee71af21a8c071207"
      },
      "first_line": 2,
      "last_line": 14,
      "claim": "Existing actor scope and actual serial/nonce/phase saved scope values",
      "lines": [
        "lyd_i3b_bind_event_effect = {",
        "    save_scope_as = lyd_i3b_actor",
        "    # Decision effect tooltips do not materialize the preceding round writes.",
        "    # Bind numeric event scope values only from a complete existing round.",
        "    if = { limit = {",
        "        has_variable = lyd_i3b_serial",
        "        has_variable = lyd_i3b_nonce",
        "        has_variable = lyd_i3b_phase",
        "    }",
        "        save_scope_value_as = { name = lyd_i3b_event_serial value = var:lyd_i3b_serial }",
        "        save_scope_value_as = { name = lyd_i3b_event_nonce value = var:lyd_i3b_nonce }",
        "        save_scope_value_as = { name = lyd_i3b_event_phase value = var:lyd_i3b_phase }",
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": {
        "path": "C:/lr29s2/mod_li_yu_dao/common/scripted_effects/lyd_i3b_setup_effects.txt",
        "bytes": 6758,
        "sha256": "1642d32f82334a97a760a53e22d072d8f1b6ffcb1ba29a8ee71af21a8c071207"
      },
      "first_line": 112,
      "last_line": 122,
      "claim": "Existing trigger_event chain using previously bound scopes",
      "lines": [
        "    if = { limit = {",
        "        lyd_i3b_can_seal_trigger = { ACTOR = root }",
        "    }",
        "        set_variable = { name = lyd_i3b_phase value = 2 }",
        "        change_variable = { name = lyd_i3b_nonce add = 1 }",
        "        lyd_i3b_bind_event_effect = yes",
        "        every_in_list = { variable = lyd_i3b_members",
        "            if = { limit = { var:lyd_i3b_was_elector = 1 } trigger_event = lyd.411 }",
        "            if = { limit = { var:lyd_i3b_was_player = 1 } trigger_event = lyd.412 }",
        "        }",
        "        trigger_event = lyd.430"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": {
        "path": "C:/lr29s2/mod_li_yu_dao/common/scripted_triggers/lyd_i3b_institution_triggers.txt",
        "bytes": 11389,
        "sha256": "42e169066766eab63dd1dd51803cbfb6c197f288223e3416a925bd37354fcb2d"
      },
      "first_line": 190,
      "last_line": 205,
      "claim": "Original headless full event_context versus reusable cancel identity tuple",
      "lines": [
        "lyd_i3b_event_context_trigger = {",
        "    exists = scope:lyd_i3b_actor",
        "    scope:lyd_i3b_actor = {",
        "        lyd_i3b_current_trigger = { ACTOR = scope:lyd_i3b_actor }",
        "        var:lyd_i3b_serial = scope:lyd_i3b_event_serial",
        "        var:lyd_i3b_nonce = scope:lyd_i3b_event_nonce",
        "        var:lyd_i3b_phase = scope:lyd_i3b_event_phase",
        "    }",
        "}",
        "lyd_i3b_cancel_context_trigger = {",
        "    exists = scope:lyd_i3b_actor",
        "    this = scope:lyd_i3b_actor",
        "    lyd_i3b_cancel_actor_trigger = yes",
        "    var:lyd_i3b_serial = scope:lyd_i3b_event_serial",
        "    var:lyd_i3b_nonce = scope:lyd_i3b_event_nonce",
        "    var:lyd_i3b_phase = scope:lyd_i3b_event_phase"
      ]
    },
    {
